title: Laura_LoadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase_Laura = "">>
<<setPhase Laura>>
<<if $dialoguePhase_Laura == "begin">>
<<jump Laura_Begin01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_Laura == "comeback">>
<<jump Laura_Comeback01>>
<<else>>
Laura: HELP I HAVE NO DIALOGUE
<<endif>>
===
title: Laura_Begin01
---
<<camMove Laura_CamRig "npc">>
Laura: HELP HOW DID I GET HERE
<<camMove Laura_CamRig "pc">>
You: OH GOD WHAT'S WRONG
<<camMove Laura_CamRig "npc">>
Laura: Oh hi!! You came for a Maxwell, right??
<<camMove Laura_CamRig "pc">>
You: I- uh... yeah?
<<camMove Laura_CamRig "npc">>
Laura: Here you go!
<<collectMaxwell GameController>>
<<camMove Laura_CamRig "pc">>
You: Thanks...
<<camMove Laura_CamRig "return">>
<<getPhase Laura "comeback">>
===
title: Laura_Comeback01
---
<<camMove Laura_CamRig "pc">>
You: Um... are you ok?
<<camMove Laura_CamRig "npc">>
Laura: No!
<<camMove Laura_CamRig "return">>
===